  inspectionTitle: "Office of the Executive Vice President \u2014 Embossing Seal"
  inspectionText: '========================================

    OFFICE OF THE EXECUTIVE
    VICE PRESIDENT

    OFFICIAL UNIVERSITY EMBOSSING SEAL

    ========================================

    "VERITAS,
    VIRTUS, SCIENTIA"


    This heavy brass embossing seal bears the official

    crest
    of Pamantasan ng Cabuyao.


    It is required to officially validate and imprint

    the
    final executive signature on senior graduation clearance.


    AUTHORIZATION
    CODE: EVP-EXEC-1994-08

    Clearance Release Order: APPROVED

    ========================================'
